  final 2026 author instructions and CFP\, which supersede an older Octobe
 r date. Prior six-page papers use IEEE proceedings subject to IEEE qualit
 y review\; the 2027 publication details await the final CFP. The exact cu
 toff hour is unknown. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Brain-comput
 er interfaces\, neural signal decoding\, multimodal brain measurements\, 
