 tyle reviewed research papers are the established publication route.\nAdd
 itional topics: Healthcare & Clinical AI\, Neuroimaging & Brain Mapping\n
 Scope sources (2027): https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2027/callforpaper.php\
 , https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2026/assets/CFP_BCI2026.pdf\nScope last ch
